<svg class="figure-wide" viewBox="0 0 660 308" role="img" aria-label="keyset deploy reads key sets from stdin, plans each against the live Worker and the wrangler target's secret list, stops on any REFUSE or without --apply, and otherwise deploys the new secrets with wrangler and checks every set's advertisement and a real recovery." font-family="'IBM Plex Sans', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
